{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a crystal island in the middle of an endless sea, you are the lone Keeper of a flock of colorful dragons and an ancient supercomputer with an agenda of its own. Care for your dragon friends, fly to faraway lands, and craft tasty desserts and powerups. The dragon is your brush, and the sky is your canvas: discover millions of color palettes and flight abilities as you paint the world.\u00a0  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655880/extras/74036292b271c588a9da31eea1af6e9c.poster.avif?t=1772563406\" aria-label=\"A red dragon with a light green belly lies in a cave, its tail forming a curlicue. \" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655880/extras/74036292b271c588a9da31eea1af6e9c.webm?t=1772563406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655880/extras/74036292b271c588a9da31eea1af6e9c.mp4?t=1772563406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655880/extras/45c97645e7900de8115165674cbacaa3.avif?t=1772563406\" alt=\"Header: Calm and Creative\" width=300 height=99 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragon Care Tarot features meditative, no-pressure gameplay: in just five minutes per session, you can explore your caring and creative sides and refresh your spirit. Each flight run ends with an insightful tarot reading to relax your mind and guide your day.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655880/extras/d3d73f27797c35994ea75ac55d7e275c.poster.avif?t=1772563406\" aria-label=\"Three tarot cards with lotuses on their backs flip, revealing three tarot cards.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655880/extras/d3d73f27797c35994ea75ac55d7e275c.webm?t=1772563406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655880/extras/d3d73f27797c35994ea75ac55d7e275c.mp4?t=1772563406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655880/extras/52260e974bb081380f1a998a9619a977.avif?t=1772563406\" alt=\"Header: Beautiful Art Made by Humans\" width=300 height=99 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragon Care Tarot features beautiful hand-animated dragons designed by Emmy Award-winners Lindsay Small-Butera and Alex Small-Butera (Later Alligator), and Ignatz Award-winner Yuko Ota (Fields of Mistria), and an original, 78-card tarot deck by SmallBu Animation Studio and Shan Horan. TV-MA (Don't Wake the Night) composed the original soundtrack, featuring 12 songs to soar to. Optimized for the Steam Deck OLED, you can play with controller or touchpad in handheld mode to truly experience the bright colors and gorgeous art.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655880/extras/c674c50194610af9f5384413f931aeb8.poster.avif?t=1772563406\" aria-label=\"A white dragon twirls over a colorful pop-up world. \" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655880/extras/c674c50194610af9f5384413f931aeb8.webm?t=1772563406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"